{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43597","headline":"游长安诸寺联句 大同坊云华寺 偶联句 · 段成式","name":"游长安诸寺联句 大同坊云华寺 偶联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"共入夕阳寺，因窥甘露门。\n清香惹苔藓，忍草杂兰荪。\n捷偈飞钳荅，新诗倚杖论。\n坏幡标古刹，圣画焕崇垣。\n岂慕穿笼鸟，难防在牖猿。\n一音唯一性，三语更三幡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段成式","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43597.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43597","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}